---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy | Grashof" description="Privacy information for the Grashof website." canonicalPath="/privacy/">
  <article class="legal-page">
    <p class="section-label">Legal</p><div class="red-rule"></div>
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p class="legal-date">Last updated · September 2026</p>
    <section><h2>Current data collection</h2><p>本網站目前不提供會員註冊、付款或線上表單，也未主動部署廣告追蹤工具</p></section>
    <section><h2>Email</h2><p>點擊 Email 連結會開啟使用者裝置上的郵件服務，寄送內容由雙方郵件服務提供者處理</p></section>
    <section><h2>Hosting logs</h2><p>網站託管服務可能基於資安、維運與故障排除，自動處理必要的技術紀錄</p></section>
    <section><h2>Future updates</h2><p>若未來新增表單、Analytics、Cookie 或其他資料處理功能，本頁將同步更新</p></section>
    <section><h2>Contact</h2><p><a href="mailto:hello@grashofstudio.com">hello@grashofstudio.com</a></p></section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .legal-page{min-height:80vh;padding:10rem var(--page-padding) 6rem}.legal-page h1{font-size:clamp(3.6rem,7vw,7rem)}.legal-date{color:var(--color-muted)}.legal-page section{max-width:54rem;padding:1.75rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--color-line)}.legal-page section h2{font-family:var(--font-body);font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0;text-transform:none}.legal-page section p{color:var(--color-muted)}.legal-page a{color:var(--color-red-bright)}
</style>
